#==============================================================================================
#
#   overload_resolution - WebIDL overload resolution for the generated bindings
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/WebIDL/OverloadResolution.cpp (lines 1-465) and
#       OverloadResolution.h (lines 1-30): the overload resolution algorithm the generated
#       bindings run on the JS arguments of a call, over LibIDL's effective overload sets. Both
#       the arguments (JS values) and the overload sets (LibIDL, used by the bindings generator)
#       are phase 3.
